        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-17T09:47:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So it seems to me like you want to deprecate this method and the one below, because the returned data might go stale any moment. Suggest\n\n    * @Deprecated the returned ServiceInfo may get stale at any time after\n    *             resolution, including immediately after the callback is\n    *             called. Prefer using {@link registerServiceCallback}, which will\n    *             keep the application up-to-date with the state of the service.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1166,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 1166,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "a317e7478b59289c7cb387b03ef632d9553eb0de",
